{%- comment -%}
  What a system is dressed in, for its own page: part 'lp' gives the Loro Piana Interiors cloths it is
  made in (empty when it is made in none), 'anchor' the cloth's place on the Loro Piana Interiors
  page, 'reason' the cloth column of the product page. Found by the product's template, then by its
  handle. Generated from bin/lp_data.py (the house's catalogue and price lists).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign k = key | default: handle
  assign keys = 'essenziale|raffaello|amalfi|bellagio|vivaldi,vivaldi-2|vivaldi-plus|monteverdi|ultra-dry|my-dream|first-dream|capri|dreamy,dreamy-2|brera|roma|topper-roma|topper-high|storage|dreamy-springs|bellini|flora|top,top-2|giotto|paisley|vicuna' | split: '|'
  assign hit = ''
  for group in keys
    assign ks = group | split: ','
    if ks contains k
      assign hit = ks.first
    endif
  endfor
  if hit == ''
    for group in keys
      assign ks = group | split: ','
      if ks contains handle
        assign hit = ks.first
      endif
    endfor
  endif
-%}
{%- case hit -%}
{%- when 'essenziale' -%}{%- case part -%}{%- when 'lp' -%}{%- when 'anchor' -%}{%- when 'reason' -%}
<h3 style="font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(21px, 2.3vw, 29px); line-height: 1.16; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 200; margin-top: 14px; max-width: 20ch;">Dressed in natural cloth.</h3>
<p style="font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.9; color: rgb(74, 68, 59); margin-top: 16px; max-width: 34ch;">Its cover is pure cotton. Another cloth on request, chosen with you at the atelier.</p>
<a href="{% render 'ms-link', to: 'materials' %}" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 24px; color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">
<span style="font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .22em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-left: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; padding-bottom: 4px;">The fibres inside →</span>
</a>
{%- endcase -%}
